    {
      "id": "noteIntro",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1548,
      "init": {
        "label": "Product launch (Gantt)",
        "body": "# Phases, typed links, and the one rule\nThe plan is a **Cube Input** with three phases. Each phase's **tasks** cell is a nested table, so a phase is a bracket that rolls up its children. A predecessor is a name (finish-to-start) or a small table of **task · type · lag**: Frontend starts two days after Design *starts* (SS+2), and Marketing starts three days before QA *finishes* (FS-3).\n\nDates never move on their own. A **start** cell holds a task no earlier than that day, **deadline** flags a late finish without moving it, and **manual** pins a task to its dates. The **status date** measures progress: Interviews is done, Synthesis is 60% done, and the unfinished part is scheduled after that day.\n\nEach task names **who** does it, so the first Gantt shows a resource band under the timeline (`histogram=on`); Ana is double-booked where Design and Synthesis overlap. Open the Gantt's chart chip, or watch the Display; the second Gantt draws the same plan as a month calendar (`layout=calendar`). **Diagnostics** lists what to look at: the lead, the SS link, the pinned task, and anything past its deadline.\n\nA **Holidays** node feeds the days to skip. **Earned Value** reads the scheduled plan with a **cost** per task and how far each is complete: as of the status date it works out the planned value, the earned value and the actual cost, then the schedule and cost variances and the **SPI** and **CPI** indices. An index below 1.0 is behind plan or over budget; **EAC** is the projected total at this pace.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tasks",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 1218,
      "init": {
        "label": "Plan",
        "cubeText": "[\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Discovery\",\n    \"tasks\": [\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Interviews\",\n        \"days\": 5,\n        \"after\": [],\n        \"complete\": 100,\n        \"who\": \"Ana\",\n        \"cost\": 1200\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Synthesis\",\n        \"days\": 3,\n        \"after\": [\n          \"Interviews\"\n        ],\n        \"complete\": 60,\n        \"who\": \"Ana\",\n        \"cost\": 900\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Build\",\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Discovery\"\n    ],\n    \"tasks\": [\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Design\",\n        \"days\": 5,\n        \"after\": [],\n        \"who\": \"Ana\",\n        \"cost\": 1500\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Frontend\",\n        \"days\": 8,\n        \"after\": [\n          {\n            \"task\": \"Design\",\n            \"type\": \"SS\",\n            \"lag\": 2\n          }\n        ],\n        \"who\": \"Bo\",\n        \"cost\": 2400\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Backend\",\n        \"days\": 8,\n        \"after\": [\n          \"Design\"\n        ],\n        \"who\": \"Cy\",\n        \"cost\": 1800\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"QA\",\n        \"days\": 4,\n        \"after\": [\n          \"Frontend\",\n          \"Backend\"\n        ],\n        \"who\": \"Bo\",\n        \"cost\": 1000\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Launch\",\n    \"tasks\": [\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Marketing\",\n        \"days\": 6,\n        \"after\": [\n          {\n            \"task\": \"QA\",\n            \"type\": \"FS\",\n            \"lag\": -3\n          }\n        ],\n        \"who\": \"Dee\",\n        \"cost\": 800\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Board review\",\n        \"days\": 1,\n        \"after\": [],\n        \"manual\": true,\n        \"start\": \"2026-03-10\",\n        \"who\": \"Dee\",\n        \"cost\": 600\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Press day\",\n        \"days\": 0,\n        \"after\": [\n          \"Marketing\",\n          \"QA\",\n          \"Board review\"\n        ],\n        \"deadline\": \"2026-03-20\",\n        \"who\": \"Dee\",\n        \"cost\": 700\n      },\n      {\n        \"task\": \"Retrospective\",\n        \"days\": 1,\n        \"after\": [\n          \"Press day\"\n        ],\n        \"who\": \"Ana\",\n        \"cost\": 500\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]"
      }
